TOOLS: the NEO-Cine library's core/ tools, which are Lemo-Opuscar's (MIT, (c) 2026 LemoLab): headless Chrome frame
  capture, events export, reading-time check, ffmpeg encode and loudness master; neo/audio/cues.py, neo/audio/master.py,
  neo/render/remote.sh.

ON SCREEN: the end card signs off with NEO-Cine and the style's name only. The song's title and its singer appear on the
  song's own title page inside the film (the scrapbook page: the 风吹新竹 seal and the hand-written "hoy neo"), as
  information about the work, as in the original video.
